 "Porcentajes aproximados. De cada 100 litros de agua del planeta, solo unos 2,5 son dulces y casi todo está congelado.": "Approximate percentages. Of every 100 litres of water on the planet, only about 2.5 are fresh and almost all of that is frozen.",
