 "¿Renovable o no renovable?": "Renewable or non-renewable?",
 "<b style=\"color:#4caf7d\">Renovables</b><ul><li>Se regeneran solas: sol, viento, agua</li><li>Casi no emiten CO₂</li><li>Dependen del tiempo que haga</li></ul>": "<b style=\"color:#4caf7d\">Renewable</b><ul><li>They replenish themselves: sun, wind, water</li><li>Almost no CO₂ emissions</li><li>Depend on the weather</li></ul>",
 "<b style=\"color:#e0873b\">No renovables</b><ul><li>Petróleo, carbón, gas, uranio</li><li>Se agotan: tardaron millones de años en formarse</li><li>Emiten gases de efecto invernadero</li></ul>": "<b style=\"color:#e0873b\">Non-renewable</b><ul><li>Oil, coal, gas, uranium</li><li>They run out: they took millions of years to form</li><li>Emit greenhouse gases</li></ul>",
